================================================================================
A complete, HIG-native SwiftUI AlertRulesPage shipped at full parity with the web source: a pure
@MainActor @Observable state holder (ADR-004 — no networking in the view) exposing loading/empty/error/
success over an injectable AlertRulesDataSource seam that ports all five web hooks (useAlertRules,
useBulkEnableRules, useBulkDisableRules, useDeleteAlertRule, useSaveAlertRule); bulk selection with a
tri-state select-all (web useBulkSelection.masterState); a BulkActionToolbar with enable/disable/delete
(delete behind a confirmationDialog); inline rename with the web 120-char validation (web EditableText);
the single GlassPanel table adaptive across macOS/iPad (aligned columns) and iPhone (stacked cards);
SeverityBadge + enabled/disabled Badge; an EditConflictBanner (web useEditLease); and a footer "Open Alert
Studio" affordance wired to the host router. Every visible string resolves from Localizable.xcstrings with
the web key names; full VoiceOver labels/traits, Voice-Control input labels, Dynamic Type, and light/dark/
increased-contrast via P2 tokens; deep-linkable via the new .alertRules route (/notifications/rules +
